{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1270,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 180,
   "text": "# Muse Glimmer 30B — model  \nRead top → bottom. **Grey bars = tensors**, length ∝ channels per token (0.08 px/channel). **Boxes = operations**, all the same size; where the parameters live is the pair of bars above. T = sequence length, P = image patches. *Layer* tab = one decoder layer in detail."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 450,
   "y": -1270,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 180,
   "text": "**Dense** decoder, 52 identical-size layers (483.9M each), pattern [sliding, sliding, sliding, full] ×13.    \n**Grey rows** — sliding window 2048 tokens + RoPE θ 500,000 · **Cyan rows** — full causal attention with **no positional encoding** (NoPE, layer_rope_theta = 0).    \nAll layers: GQA 32 Q / 2 KV heads × 128, sigmoid-gated attention output, SwiGLU 19968, 4 RMSNorms per layer (sandwich). Context 131,072."
  },
  {
   "id": "raw1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -960,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**raw text**  \"The cat sat…\"",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
