  {
   "id": "band",
   "type": "group",
   "x": -16,
   "y": -538,
   "width": 332,
   "height": 2120,
   "label": "52 DECODER LAYERS · 25.17B",
   "color": "#38bdf8"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-pattern",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -560,
   "y": 492,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 230,
   "text": "**Layer pattern** — 39 sliding + 13 full layers.  \nSliding layers attend to the last 2048 tokens and rotate q/k with RoPE; full layers see the whole context and carry no position signal at all (they rely on causal masking and the sliding layers for order).  \nKV cache per token per layer: K+V = 2 × 2 × 128 = 512 values — a sliding layer keeps at most 2048 tokens, so long-context memory is dominated by the 13 full layers."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-layer",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -560,
   "y": 762,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "**One layer** = 483.9M: attention 85.2M (q, k, v, o + a 4096-wide output gate) + SwiGLU MLP 398.7M (82%).  \nLogits: lm head × 0.1961, then softcap 20·tanh(z / 20)."
  },
  {
   "id": "img8",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -630,
   "y": -960,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**image** pixels (video: frame pairs)",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "patch9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -527,
   "y": -864,
   "width": 94,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
