   "width": 300,
   "height": 72,
   "text": "**verify**: main model scores all 16  \ndrafts in one forward pass",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-dflash",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1850,
   "y": 2214,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "Speculative decoding, shipped as a separate repo (meta-models/Muse-Glimmer-30B-assistant, 2.56B). The drafter has no embedding or head of its own: it embeds the last accepted token + 15 mask tokens with the target's table, attends bidirectionally inside the block and causally to the tapped context (target_layer_ids [1, 13, 25, 37, 49]). Not counted in the budget bars above."
  },
